		<Server Name="ErrorConfig" GUID="{C926A1B5-3FE9-495F-8D16-6690F0A1CF2E}" Visualized="true" Initialize="true" DefValue="2#0000000" WriteProtected="false" Retentive="false" Comment="By setting or clearing individual bits, error messages can be enabled or&#13;&#10;disabled. This server must be initialized.&#13;&#10;============================================================================&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Case: a movement-command carries out no movement of the axis&#13;&#10;Bit 1: bPosChangeWarning&#13;&#10;FALSE ... error is ignored&#13;&#10;TRUE  ... a warning is displayed&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Case: while calculating a parameter with the intern resolution-factor, an overflow error occurred&#13;&#10;Bit 2: bResolutionError&#13;&#10;TRUE  ... an error is displayed&#13;&#10;FALSE ... a warning is displayed&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Case: an axis has achieved a limiting position or a Safety-Position&#13;&#10;Bit 3: bPosLimitError&#13;&#10;TRUE  ... an error is displayed&#13;&#10;FALSE ... a warning is displayed&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Case: the definition of circle-parameters is erroneous &#13;&#10;Bit 4: bCircleError&#13;&#10;TRUE  ... an error is displayed&#13;&#10;FALSE ... a warning is displayed&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Case: one of the parameters: Velocity, Acceleration or Jerk is less than 1  &#13;&#10;Bit 5: bCmdLimitError&#13;&#10;TRUE  ... an error is displayed&#13;&#10;FALSE ... a warning is displayed&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Case: while calculating the coupling-factors of an axis, an overflow error occurred&#13;&#10;Bit 6: bKoFacError&#13;&#10;TRUE  ... an error is displayed&#13;&#10;FALSE ... a warning is displayed&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Case: the endpoint of a movement is inside of a safety zone&#13;&#10;Bit 7: bSafetyZonesError&#13;&#10;FALSE: a warning is issued when the endpoint of a movement is inside of a safety zone&#13;&#10;TRUE : an error is issued when the endpoint of a movement is inside of a safety zone"/>
		<Server Name="MoveType" GUID="{79C05DC3-6DB8-4C6F-987B-542F38196821}" Visualized="true" Initialize="true" DefValue="RAMP_PROFILE" WriteProtected="false" Retentive="File" Comment="With this server a motion-type can be selected:&#13;&#10;RAMP_PROFILE -&gt; the motion is defined by a ramp limiting velocity and acceleraation / deceleration&#13;&#10;JERK_PROFILE -&gt; the motion is defined by a smooth function limiting velocity, acceleraation / deceleration and jerk &#13;&#10;This server must be initialized.&#13;&#10; "/>
		<Server Name="OpMode" GUID="{94EC5842-EA0F-4DE5-B309-9D73F54F1B55}" Visualized="true" Initialize="true" DefValue="_LMC_AUTOMATIC" WriteProtected="false" Retentive="false" Comment="AUTOMATIC:&#13;&#10;In the automatic mode, a movement is processed and set values for the individual axes are calculated as soon as it is loaded.&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;MANUAL&#13;&#10;In manual operation, the loaded movement-commands are not started automatically. A command to the start must be given. &#13;&#10;Once given, the axes moves to the next end point and stops according to the command mode.&#13;&#10;If the axes are in idle status, a new start command must be sent in order to continue."/>
